From 1c0133aee563ba56125297f838b6b5184877b2e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 13:10:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] GT teacher loader: refuse a checkpoint trained as another
 policy or map cache

Teacher and student share the architecture, so an LLM-Grid student
checkpoint loads into the teacher without a missing key and the run would
silently distil the student into itself. The checkpoint's saved config names
the policy and the map cache namespace it was trained with; both must match
IL.gt_teacher_policy_name / IL.gt_teacher_map_namespace. Checkpoints without
a saved config pass. Test lifts the function with ast (the trainer imports
habitat).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Q37SwHSfdSLWwALjMD6Pvv
---
